-- Section (4): Cross-Perspective Links (Adlam and Rovelli 2023) and warrant transfer for StableFor.
-- A joint state of system S and observer A's pointer is a list of ((s, a), amplitude).
-- It is correlated when every disagreeing pair (eqX s a = false) has zero amplitude.
RqmCorrelated : (X A : Type) → A → (X → X → Bool) → List ((X × X) × A) → Type
RqmCorrelated X A z eqX psi = case psi of
  nil → Unit
  cons p rest → (eqX (fst (fst p)) (snd (fst p)) ≡ false → snd p ≡ z) × RqmCorrelated X A z eqX rest
